$ moolah init --base ILS --no-backup-key
Book "main" is ready in $TMP/data/books/main.db (base currency ILS).
Next: add your accounts, for example:
  moolah account add assets:bank:mybank --currency ILS --opening 1000
  moolah category list

$ moolah book add mom --base USD --no-backup-key
Created book "mom". Switch to it with: moolah book use mom

$ moolah book list
* main
  mom

$ moolah book use mom
Now using book "mom".

$ moolah config get base_currency
USD

$ moolah --book main config get base_currency
ILS

$ moolah book use main
Now using book "main".

$ moolah book list
* main
  mom

$ moolah book use nobody
error: book "nobody" does not exist. Create it with: moolah book add nobody
[exit 1]

$ moolah config set offline true
Set offline.

$ moolah config set backup_dir relative/path
error: backup_dir must be an absolute path
[exit 1]

$ moolah config list
Setting           Value  Stored in
backup_dir               this computer
backup_recipient         book
base_currency     ILS    book
locale            en_US  book
offline           true   this computer
rate_sources             book

"book" settings sync with your other computers; "this computer" settings are in $TMP/config/config.toml.

